# NET_EXPECT for time_*.txt: the host's ranks when the time is up (lives, then kills, then deaths).
Ann: the time is up
Ben: the time is up
Cid: the time is up
Ann: result: 1st  Ann \(Yellow\)  1 kill, 0 deaths
Ann: result: 2nd  Cid \(Blue\)  0 kills, 0 deaths
Ann: result: 3rd  Ben \(Orange\)  0 kills, 1 death
Ben: result: 1st  Ann \(Yellow\)  1 kill, 0 deaths
Cid: result: 3rd  Ben \(Orange\)  0 kills, 1 death
